  "name": "Question 8",
  "problem": "Over $6$ days, $$14.70$ is deducted from a transit card balance due to daily fares of equal size. What is the change in the balance each day?",
  "worked_solution": "Since the balance decreases by $$14.70$ over $6$ days, the total change is $-$14.70.$\n\nThis change occurs evenly over $6$ days, so we divide the total change by $6:$\n\n$$\n-14.70÷6\n$$\n\nEvaluating the quotient, we get\n\n$$\n-14.70÷6=-2.45.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the change in the balance each day is $-$2.45.$",
